*HEADING
Cylindrical-bending SOLID benchmark strip (Yu-2003 sec.-6.2 analog)
** Yu-2003 sec.-6.2 analog, case1: plies (bottom->top) yu(0.5in/15), yu(0.5in/-15)
** L/h = 4 (a = 4 in, h = 1 in), p0 = 1 psi, psi/in units
** 3-D SOLID BENCHMARK (replaces Pagano in the 6.2 chain)
** a = 4 in, h = 1 in, q0 = p0 = 1 psi split +-p0/2 on the faces
** 160 x 1 x 20 C3D8I; width ties = infinite plate; ends u3 = 0
** extraction: COL0 centroid x = 0.0125 (divide s13/s23 by cos(p*x) = 0.99995181)
**             COLM centroid x = 2.0125 (divide s33 by sin(p*x) = 0.99995181)
